  "notes": "The native renderer has no texture registry: each pass loads its own pre-converted dumps (raster_texture.c for the atlas, raster_hud.c for the GUI sheets, raster_mobs.c for skins) and binds them by pointer, not by GL id. The recordings exercise this class implicitly on the Java side of every frame. idxaudit 2026-09-27: scope reason rewritten.",
  "scope_reason": "The GL texture registry (ResourceLocation to texture object, bindTexture, the tickable list). Native keeps no texture registry: each pass loads its own dumps, and the per-tick TextureMap animation it calls is ported in csrc/engine/texanim.c."
